From caceade7273e50bfa65bf69fcf32b1792771108e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tommi <tommi@webrtc.org>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:27:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Keep SRTP sessions when activating RTCP mux

JsepTransport::ActivateRtcpMux() cleared the RTCP DTLS transport before
RTCP mux was enabled on the RtpTransport. DtlsSrtpTransport then didn't
recognize the removal as part of activating RTCP mux, reset the active
SRTP sessions and set them up again from the RTP DTLS transport,
discarding their state.

Enable RTCP mux on the RtpTransport before clearing the RTCP transport,
so that DtlsSrtpTransport keeps the sessions.

Fixed: chromium:513198336
Change-Id: I85d81d572ffe38770650d07531ce3af4d0e83647
Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/510781
Reviewed-by: Danil Chapovalov <danilchap@webrtc.org>
Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson <tommi@webrtc.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#49019}
---
 pc/jsep_transport.cc | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/pc/jsep_transport.cc b/pc/jsep_transport.cc
index 18899b2..5e1d7b0 100644
--- a/pc/jsep_transport.cc
+++ b/pc/jsep_transport.cc
@@ -399,7 +399,10 @@ bool JsepTransport::SetRtcpMux(bool enable,
 void JsepTransport::ActivateRtcpMux() {
   RTC_DCHECK_RUN_ON(&transport_sequence_);
   // If the transport is a DtlsSrtpTransport, it needs to know that RTCP mux
-  // is active to clear its RTCP transport.
+  // is active to clear its RTCP transport. This must happen before the RTCP
+  // transport is cleared, otherwise the active SRTP sessions would be reset
+  // and set up again with the same keys.
+  rtp_transport_->SetRtcpMuxEnabled(true);
   if (auto* dtls_srtp_transport = rtp_transport_->AsDtlsSrtpTransport()) {
     dtls_srtp_transport->SetDtlsTransports(rtp_dtls_transport(),
                                            /*rtcp_dtls_transport=*/nullptr);
-- 
